{
  "$comment": "Single source of TIA Portal versions and native components for the TS server (src/tia-version.ts) and the native build (tools/Build-TiaNative.ps1). Adding a version: add or complete one row, then build its adapter. adapter null = recognized only. A row's capabilities are the allowed upper bound; a capability is verified when a companion built for that version passes its self-test and reports it (see docs/multi-version-architecture.md for which launches require that).",
  "defaultVersion": "V20",
  "$apiFeatureComment": "Public API features the native sources use only where the version has them. Build-TiaNative.ps1 defines TIA_API_<NAME> for each feature a row lists; without it the companion compiles its fallback and reports the feature as unavailable.",
